   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_ZURI_06">Seefeldstrasse 73</name> <hi rend="superscript">III</hi>, <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_ZURI">Zurich</name>
                            </addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                </div> <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Dear <name type="person" key="weav76">Miss Weaver</name>: I have succeeded in inducing a bookseller here (<seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">
                            <name type="person">Ebell</name>
                        </seg>, Bahnhofstrasse) to take on a <seg xml:id="seg2" type="note-anchor">dozen copies</seg>. The unsold if there be any I shall buy in. I have also brought <rs type="work" key="W_APORTRAIT">the book</rs> under the notice of the literary editor of the <name type="work">
                            <hi rend="underline">Neue</hi> <hi rend="underline">Zürcher</hi> <hi rend="underline">Zeitung</hi>
                        </name> and he promises to allow a Triestine friend of mine to review it in a <hi rend="underline">feuilleton</hi>. I have written to <name type="person" key="vida75">Mr Vidacovich</name> and to some other friends in Italy about the book.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>        	With kind regards</salute>
                        <salute>                    	sincerely yours</salute>
                        <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">                                	James Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                        <dateline>
                            <date when="1917-07-22">22/7/917</date>
                        </dateline> </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">C. M. Ebell, book and art dealer, 1 Bahnhofstrasse 14, Zurich.</note>
                <note xml:id="note2" target="#seg2" type="commentary">Copies of <name type="work" key="W_APORTRAIT">A Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man</name>.</note>
            </div>
      </body>
   </text>
